# Citation metadata for the experimental GitHub release 0.1.0.dev5 (2026-10-22).
# A DOI will be added after the Zenodo archive of the GitHub release is created.
# The associated paper ("Fast and accurate rare-event simulation by Markov chain
# Monte Carlo for general quantum codes") is in preparation and is not yet a citable reference.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Authorship is confirmed by the project owner. Cite the GitHub repository
  and version until a DOI is assigned.
type: software
title: "mcmc4qec"
authors:
  - given-names: Junichi
    family-names: Haruna
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1828-8183"
    affiliation: "Kyoto University; University of Osaka"
version: "0.1.0.dev5"
