repository-code: "https://github.com/junichiharuna/mcmc4qec"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Rare-event MCMC primitives for quantum error correction: exact enumeration,
  direct Monte Carlo, failure-conditioned sampling with OBF, Zanella, cluster
  exchange, and stabilizer kernels, and anchored BAR splitting for logical
  error probabilities of CSS codes. Experimental research software; the
  associated paper has not been assigned publication metadata in this file.
